{'symbol': 'NTRS', 'date': '2023-02-22 04:18:00', 'title': 'NORTHERN TRUST TO OFFER INTEGRATION WITH SIMCORP AS PART OF ITS WHOLE OFFICE™ STRATEGY', 'text': 'LONDON & COPENHAGEN--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AS PART OF ITS CONTINUING WHOLE OFFICE™ STRATEGY TO SERVE CLIENT NEEDS ACROSS THE ENTIRE INVESTMENT LIFECYCLE, NORTHERN TRUST (NASDAQ: NTRS) HAS REACHED AN AGREEMENT WITH SIMCORP®, A LEADING PROVIDER OF SOFTWARE AS A SERVICE (SAAS) INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS, TO ENABLE INTEGRATION FOR EFFICIENT DATA EXCHANGE FOR CLIENTS USING THE SIMCORP DIMENSION® PLATFORM.'}